    {
      "id": "668fe0e8-9f8b-4ed9-aa87-c692d59040e0",
      "type": "Output/Note",
      "x": 12,
      "y": -179,
      "w": 640,
      "h": 157,
      "state": {
        "Text": "10 \u2014 FILES, IMAGES AND THE SYSTEM   (writes to %TEMP%\\vnoder-showcase)\n\nA banner drawn and saved as PNG, grey PNG and a flipped WebP thumbnail, an HTML report with the image embedded, and a backup copied and moved. Also: drive space, machine and OS details, processes, an environment variable and a program\u0027s output.\n\nPress Run Once (Ctrl\u002BR) and read the Outputs. Each task sits in its own group; collapse the ones you are not reading (double-click a header).\n\nDelete %TEMP%\\vnoder-showcase* to clean up after 05 and 10."
      }
    }
  ],
